      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the quick reply. i checked the undersides like you said but i'm struggling to actually see anything specific. it's like they're just there one minute and gone the next. it's almost like they're hiding or something. are there any other things it could be besides insects? maybe some kind of fungus or damage from the environment?",
