      "content": "idk, it's just really weird. i've been a grower for years and i haven't seen anything move this fast. it's like these little things are literally lurking in the shadows or tucked away in places i can't reach, just popping out to do damage and then vanishing. it's getting a bit creepy tbh. do you think there could be any way to trap them if they're too small or too good at hiding to see?",
